 "captions": [
  {
   "s": 0.34,
   "e": 2.49,
   "text": "Assalamualaikum, Farhan.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 3.38,
   "e": 7.253,
   "text": "Thank you, Farhan, for having your time\nhere.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 7.253,
   "e": 9.943,
   "text": "I know you have been through a very\ndifficult time.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 11.193,
   "e": 13.143,
   "text": "So, how are you feeling today?",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 15.333,
   "e": 17.623,
   "text": "I'm okay. Just a minute.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 17.773,
   "e": 20.943,
   "text": "Just a minute. I can stop thinking about\nthat case.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 21.553,
   "e": 23.733,
   "text": "Never mind, Farhan.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 23.733,
   "e": 28.263,
   "text": "Take your time. We can sit quietly here to\ndiscuss.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 28.333,
   "e": 32.523,
   "text": "Or maybe you don't have to do this thing\nto me until you are ready.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 33.727,
   "e": 35.307,
   "text": "Honestly, not that great.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 35.307,
   "e": 40.297,
   "text": "I know these things happen, but I keep\nreplaying every step in my head.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 40.507,
   "e": 43.837,
   "text": "It sounds like the event is still in your\nmind.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 44.167,
   "e": 46.317,
   "text": "Even the procedure has ended.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 47.74,
   "e": 50.61,
   "text": "Yes, the patient wasn't expected to die.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 51.44,
   "e": 53.24,
   "text": "Everything happened so quickly.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": [
    "Everything"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 53.24,
   "e": 54.49,
   "text": "We tried everything.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 54.9,
   "e": 58.97,
   "text": "The whole team was resuscitating, but we\ncouldn't save the patient.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 59.66,
   "e": 67.79,
   "text": "That must be incredibly difficult for you,\nsince your work is to save someone's life.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 68.56,
   "e": 70.84,
   "text": "I keep wondering whether I missed\nsomething.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 70.84,
   "e": 74.35,
   "text": "Maybe I should have recognised the\ndeterioration earlier.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 74.883,
   "e": 80.233,
   "text": "I hear how much responsibility that you\nhave to bear.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 81.843,
   "e": 88.263,
   "text": "I know I want you to know that this is a\nspace to discuss or to open up, because we",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "know"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 88.263,
   "e": 89.733,
   "text": "are not here to judge you.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 90.023,
   "e": 93.193,
   "text": "So, I'm here to listen and support you.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 94.69,
   "e": 99.57,
   "text": "I know we all did what we could, but I\nstill feel like I should have seen it",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 99.57,
   "e": 100.57,
   "text": "coming.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 102.053,
   "e": 106.673,
   "text": "I know it is understandable that the\nmoments keep replaying in your heart and",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "I"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 106.673,
   "e": 107.673,
   "text": "in your mind.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "in"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 109.313,
   "e": 112.633,
   "text": "Sometimes we are always questioning our\ndecision.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "are"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 112.633,
   "e": 113.573,
   "text": "Whether it's a decision or not.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "a",
    "decision",
    "or",
    "not."
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 113.573,
   "e": 114.903,
   "text": "Whether it's right or wrong.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "Whether"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 117.033,
   "e": 121.127,
   "text": "I keep hearing the monitor in my head\nevery day, every night.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": [
    "keep"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 121.517,
   "e": 127.507,
   "text": "Even when I close my eyes, I still can\nhear the monitor.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 127.717,
   "e": 131.997,
   "text": "That sounds exhausting Farhan, since you\nare already away from the operation",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "are",
    "operation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 131.997,
   "e": 132.997,
   "text": "theatre.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 135.637,
   "e": 140.797,
   "text": "Yes. I haven't been sleeping properly for\nalmost a few days.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 140.797,
   "e": 143.797,
   "text": "I haven't been eaten properly since it\nhappened.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 143.797,
   "e": 145.467,
   "text": "No quality of life.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 146.34,
   "e": 151.66,
   "text": "Um... Well, thank you for telling me that\nyou have this...",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "Um..."
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 151.66,
   "e": 155.71,
   "text": "I understand this affects you emotionally\nand physically.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 157.68,
   "e": 163.1,
   "text": "And I want you to understand something\nthat feeling distressed after a patient",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 163.1,
   "e": 168.51,
   "text": "died unexpectedly does not mean that you\nare weak or you are not competent.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "are"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 171.0,
   "e": 174.05,
   "text": "Everyone seems to be.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 174.24,
   "e": 175.69,
   "text": "I've moved on.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": [
    "I've",
    "moved"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 176.14,
   "e": 180.09,
   "text": "I feel like I am the only one struggling\nright now.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 180.713,
   "e": 187.793,
   "text": "Well, sometimes when people respond\ndifferently to different situations, it",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "when"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 187.793,
   "e": 191.623,
   "text": "doesn't mean that they appear okay.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 191.993,
   "e": 193.653,
   "text": "They are not affected.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 193.653,
   "e": 197.763,
   "text": "You don't have to compare your reaction\nwith others.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 199.293,
   "e": 201.723,
   "text": "You know what? I feel very guilty.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 201.813,
   "e": 203.933,
   "text": "Maybe I should be stronger than this.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 203.933,
   "e": 209.453,
   "text": "You are human before you become an\nanesthesiologist.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 211.363,
   "e": 219.033,
   "text": "It's okay for you to feel sad or shaken,\nconfused or even feel guilty.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "feel",
    "confused"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 220.303,
   "e": 223.913,
   "text": "You don't have to force yourself to be\nstrong all the time.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 224.303,
   "e": 230.053,
   "text": "To be honest, I don't really want to go\nback to the theatre right now.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 230.243,
   "e": 232.473,
   "text": "I almost call in sick tomorrow.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 232.823,
   "e": 238.093,
   "text": "I don't know. I don't know if I can trust\neven myself anymore.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": [
    "I"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 239.583,
   "e": 241.713,
   "text": "I appreciate your honesty, Farhan.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 242.503,
   "e": 246.853,
   "text": "It sounds that you are overwhelmed and not\nready to go to work.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 247.483,
   "e": 254.663,
   "text": "Yeah, I am worried that if something\nhappens again, I may not be able to cope",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 254.663,
   "e": 256.213,
   "text": "with the situation anymore.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 257.363,
   "e": 262.163,
   "text": "Given your experience, I know that you\ndeserve attention.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 262.163,
   "e": 266.413,
   "text": "Can I ask why you don't trust yourself?",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "Can"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 267.283,
   "e": 273.213,
   "text": "Are you worried about your ability to\nperform in the future?",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 273.943,
   "e": 278.813,
   "text": "I mean, I'm afraid that I won't be able to\nfocus properly.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 279.003,
   "e": 280.883,
   "text": "I just feel mentally exhausted.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 280.883,
   "e": 282.513,
   "text": "I just want to rest.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 283.173,
   "e": 285.833,
   "text": "Well, thank you for clarifying.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 285.833,
   "e": 288.423,
   "text": "Your well-being and safety matters.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 288.653,
   "e": 291.933,
   "text": "So, I would encourage for you to discuss.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 291.933,
   "e": 293.703,
   "text": "With your immediate support.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "With"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 293.893,
   "e": 299.583,
   "text": "Maybe to render whether you are ready or\nnot to return to duties.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "to",
    "are",
    "to"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 300.94,
   "e": 306.25,
   "text": "But I am afraid people will think that I\nam not capable of doing my job.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 306.76,
   "e": 308.73,
   "text": "Don't worry. Don't worry.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 308.88,
   "e": 314.61,
   "text": "Seeking support is not a sign of\nincompetence.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 314.7,
   "e": 319.27,
   "text": "You are actually recognizing a symptom.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "are"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 320.16,
   "e": 323.66,
   "text": "This is important. Because you know you\nneed help.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "Because"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 323.66,
   "e": 328.61,
   "text": "You need help. And you want to be ready\nbefore you go to work.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 329.3,
   "e": 331.33,
   "text": "So, what should I do now?",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 332.047,
   "e": 334.737,
   "text": "Well, can we start from the basics?",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "basics?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 336.507,
   "e": 338.527,
   "text": "Have you had enough rest?",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 338.527,
   "e": 339.867,
   "text": "Have you been eating?",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 339.867,
   "e": 342.177,
   "text": "Is there someone that you can rely on?",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 342.607,
   "e": 343.657,
   "text": "Not really.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 344.327,
   "e": 347.277,
   "text": "I've just been keeping everything to\nmyself.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 347.993,
   "e": 351.443,
   "text": "Okay. You don't have to manage this alone.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 351.493,
   "e": 353.793,
   "text": "We can explore practical support.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 353.793,
   "e": 355.863,
   "text": "Maybe we can find for you.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 357.013,
   "e": 363.123,
   "text": "Your supervisor can supervise your current\ncapacity of your clinical judgment.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 363.373,
   "e": 367.483,
   "text": "You need time. We understand you need time\nto recover.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 367.673,
   "e": 371.523,
   "text": "And we will arrange follow-up for you\nlater.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 372.22,
   "e": 375.79,
   "text": "I think I need that support.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 376.76,
   "e": 379.78,
   "text": "Good. Good. That's a good first step.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 381.01,
   "e": 383.98,
   "text": "Let's not pressure to answer everything\ntoday.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 384.55,
   "e": 386.94,
   "text": "We can go this step by step.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 388.43,
   "e": 392.16,
   "text": "I don't know. I still don't know how to\nstop thinking about that patient.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": [
    "patient."
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 394.57,
   "e": 400.61,
   "text": "I don't force you to quickly switch off\nthe thoughts.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 400.61,
   "e": 406.62,
   "text": "So, when they come, we try not to\nrecognize them without judging yourself.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 407.47,
   "e": 408.91,
   "text": "You have to give permission.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 408.91,
   "e": 414.71,
   "text": "You have to give time for yourself to\nregulate, to eat regularly, to go and",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 414.71,
   "e": 422.34,
   "text": "rest. And we want you to reconnect back to\nyour friends and colleagues.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 422.35,
   "e": 427.76,
   "text": "We also can work together on strategies to\nmanage any distressing moments.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 428.66,
   "e": 433.17,
   "text": "I suppose I never thought that doctors\ncould be affected this much by losing a",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 433.17,
   "e": 434.333,
   "text": "patient.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 434.333,
   "e": 439.28,
   "text": "Well, you have to understand healthcare\nprofessionals are also often affected",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "well"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 439.28,
   "e": 442.279,
   "text": "during the care for your patients.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 442.279,
   "e": 446.16,
   "text": "Sometimes we forget that we also need\ncare.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 446.16,
   "e": 452.23,
   "text": "You deserve the same compassion as much as\nhow much you give to your patients.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 454.567,
   "e": 462.667,
   "text": "Thank you. I didn't realize how much I\nneeded someone just to sit and listen",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": [
    "how",
    "one"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 462.667,
   "e": 463.667,
   "text": "to me.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 464.413,
   "e": 469.023,
   "text": "I'm glad you shared with me today, Farhan.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 470.073,
   "e": 472.013,
   "text": "Remember, you are not alone.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 472.013,
   "e": 473.563,
   "text": "We will work this together,",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 475.033,
   "e": 477.863,
   "text": "right, at a pace that manageable for you.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 478.473,
   "e": 480.963,
   "text": "Thank you. I feel a little bit lighter.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 482.153,
   "e": 483.883,
   "text": "Before we finish,",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 484.193,
   "e": 487.523,
   "text": "maybe we can arrange more session after\nthis?",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 487.913,
   "e": 489.503,
   "text": "Thank you so much. I really need that\nsupport.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  },
  {
   "s": 490.033,
   "e": 492.133,
   "text": "Okay, thank you.",
   "spk": "K",
   "lowconf": [
    "Okay,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 492.133,
   "e": 493.183,
   "text": "Thank you.",
   "spk": "F",
   "lowconf": []
  }
 ],
